cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite the specific data release (tag) you
  used. This is an example hub containing synthetic data; do not cite it as
  evidence about training.
type: dataset
title: "MacroFactor Foundation Example Database Hub"
abstract: >-
  A worked example of the MacroFactor Foundation living-database pattern: a
  normalized corpus of (synthetic) resistance-training study data stored as
  plain CSV tables in Git, with schema validation, an analysis pipeline, and a
  static site. Spoke projects pin to immutable data tags.
authors:
